=== a linked worktree sees the main repository's refs and remotes
[git checkout feature/login ][]
[git branch maint ][]
[git push upstream ][]
[git push origin master ][]
=== the main checkout gives the same answers
[git checkout feature/login ][]
[git push upstream ][]
=== checkout offers tags, remote branches and names it can create
[git checkout v1.0 ][]
[git checkout upstream/][]
[git checkout upstream/topic ][]
[git checkout topic ][]
[git checkout rel][]
=== switch offers branches and creatable names, not tags
[git switch topic ][]
[git switch v][]
=== merge, rebase and friends offer every ref
[git merge v1.0 ][]
[git rebase origin/release ][]
=== a reftable repository is listed by git for-each-ref
[git checkout alpha ][]
[git checkout v2.0 ][]
[git switch beta ][]
